1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 21=

5
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:40,439
Dad, Mommy,

6
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,439
I'm off to bed.

7
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,520
(If I tell her how I feel,)

8
00:00:53,159 --> 00:00:54,039
(will she say yes?)

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,920
(If I ask to move out,)

10
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:58,479
(will he agree?)

11
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:04,239
Mr. Xie,

12
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:07,519
I'd like to talk about something.

13
00:01:07,959 --> 00:01:08,400
Go ahead.

14
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:12,000
The house is so far from work.

15
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,959
It's a two-hour round trip.

16
00:01:14,439 --> 00:01:15,079
I'd like

17
00:01:15,799 --> 00:01:17,719
to rent an apartment near the office.

18
00:01:18,159 --> 00:01:18,799
You want to move out?

19
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:19,960
Yes.

20
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:23,079
As our agreement says,

21
00:01:23,439 --> 00:01:25,120
we won't interfere
with each other's freedom.

22
00:01:29,079 --> 00:01:31,239
(She's still not ready.)

23
00:01:31,239 --> 00:01:33,640
♪We all know what's right♪

24
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,079
Okay.

25
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:38,280
♪But my heart feels empty♪

26
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:41,280
♪There's no use in begging♪

27
00:01:41,599 --> 00:01:42,159
But

28
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:43,959
if you really move out...

29
00:01:43,959 --> 00:01:45,680
♪Hold on tight, and then let go♪

30
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:46,760
I'm not sure I'll get used to it.

31
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:49,880
♪Like when you burst into my life♪

32
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:52,560
♪You came, only to leave again♪

33
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,800
♪I stand here♪

34
00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:55,800
♪Waiting for the pouring rain♪

35
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:57,040
♪Though my eyes are wet♪

36
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:59,160
♪I'll still laugh out loud♪

37
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:00,640
♪If you turn around♪

38
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:02,320
♪Please hold me tight♪

39
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:03,680
♪Like a tragic movie♪

40
00:02:07,239 --> 00:02:08,599
Look at this location.

41
00:02:08,879 --> 00:02:10,840
Only ten minutes from your office!

42
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:11,759
So convenient, right?

43
00:02:13,039 --> 00:02:14,280
It is a good location,

44
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,560
but it can't be cheap.

45
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:18,280
How much is the rent?

46
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,759
Price isn't a problem.

47
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:24,719
I've already thought it all through.

48
00:02:25,639 --> 00:02:26,599
Bao'er,

49
00:02:26,759 --> 00:02:28,000
could you spare a thought

50
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,520
for your broke friend?

51
00:02:29,759 --> 00:02:31,039
I did!

52
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,360
Don't worry.

53
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,199
I've already worked it out
with the landlord.

54
00:02:37,039 --> 00:02:37,599
Come on.

55
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:39,960
Let's take a look at the place.

56
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,599
(This is the home I dreamed of
back in college.)

57
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,120
(A little space of my own,)

58
00:02:47,639 --> 00:02:48,840
(warm and cozy.)

59
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:49,719
Well?

60
00:02:50,199 --> 00:02:50,759
Pretty, right?

61
00:02:51,479 --> 00:02:53,000
I asked the landlady

62
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,879
to decorate it just the way you like.

63
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,479
Stylish and cozy.

64
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,520
Didn't you say in college

65
00:02:58,639 --> 00:02:59,599
that after graduation,

66
00:02:59,759 --> 00:03:00,960
you wanted to rent a place like this?

67
00:03:02,199 --> 00:03:02,639
So?

68
00:03:03,159 --> 00:03:04,199
Am I your best friend or what?

69
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,560
You know me best.

70
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,400
(Now,)

71
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,960
(I'll finally have a place of my own.)

72
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,280
Ma'am,

73
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:15,000
I really love the apartment.

74
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,560
How much is the rent?

75
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:19,520
5,000 yuan.

76
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:20,960
I can't go any lower.

77
00:03:23,319 --> 00:03:24,599
Only 5,000?

78
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,840
(An apartment
in the financial district,)

79
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,719
(with this location and decor,)

80
00:03:31,159 --> 00:03:32,560
(should cost at least 8,000 to 10,000.)

81
00:03:32,919 --> 00:03:34,120
(And she only wants 5,000?)

82
00:03:34,639 --> 00:03:37,319
(Dad actually bought all this
for you in advance.)

83
00:03:40,919 --> 00:03:42,439
The landlady's daughter

84
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,840
is going abroad to study.

85
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:45,120
So she needs to rent

86
00:03:45,319 --> 00:03:47,000
this apartment out quickly.

87
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,800
A good place won't wait for you.

88
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:49,840
Don't hesitate.

89
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:52,599
That's right, dear.

90
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,479
You seem so sweet and sensible,

91
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:55,560
and I like you.

92
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:56,800
If

93
00:03:56,919 --> 00:03:59,240
you sign a three-year lease,

94
00:03:59,719 --> 00:04:01,199
water, electricity and heating

95
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:02,319
are all on me.

96
00:04:02,759 --> 00:04:03,199
Well?

97
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,159
That's generous, right?

98
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:06,199
(Utilities and heating included?)

99
00:04:06,639 --> 00:04:07,759
(This isn't renting.)

100
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,360
(She's practically letting me
live here for free!)

101
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,520
(Can I really be this lucky?)

102
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:15,000
Well, I...

103
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,240
Your colleague Bei Ruo

104
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,480
lives around here, doesn't she?

105
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,000
Why don't you ask her?

106
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,160
Excuse me a moment, ma'am.

107
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,680
I think we've got this.

108
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:35,120
I never fail when I'm on the job.

109
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,160
Hi, Bei Ruo.

110
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,800
I'm looking at a place
at Mingxi Apartments.

111
00:04:46,439 --> 00:04:48,839
The landlady told me
the rent's only 5,000,

112
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,800
with utilities and heating included.

113
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,000
Does that sound legit?

114
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:54,720
Absolutely!

115
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,920
You've found a real bargain.

116
00:04:57,439 --> 00:05:00,000
Is it Building 1, Unit 1203?

117
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,879
I know that landlady.

118
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:03,360
She owns over a dozen apartments.

119
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,839
She doesn't need your rent money.

120
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:08,000
She probably just likes you.

121
00:05:08,079 --> 00:05:09,600
That's why it's such a good deal.

122
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:10,879
Go ahead and rent it.

123
00:05:12,399 --> 00:05:12,920
Okay.

124
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:17,399
See?

125
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,079
Ma'am,

126
00:05:20,079 --> 00:05:20,519
I'll take it.

127
00:05:21,079 --> 00:05:22,240
Let's sign the lease now.

128
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:23,399
Let's sign.

129
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,040
Okay, let's sign!

130
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:44,600
♪You say you♪

131
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:46,480
♪Don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

132
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:49,880
♪You're just fine on your own♪

133
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:53,040
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

134
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:56,040
♪And the pain you face at night♪

135
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:59,720
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

136
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:02,920
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

137
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:06,000
♪Some love needs no promises♪

138
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:09,360
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

139
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:12,040
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

140
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:15,360
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

141
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:18,200
♪I'm right behind you♪

142
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:21,760
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

143
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:24,400
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

144
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:28,360
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

145
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:34,680
♪I'm right behind you♪

146
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:36,480
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

147
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,320
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

148
00:06:38,320 --> 00:06:40,880
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

149
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:42,320
♪I'm right behind you♪

150
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:44,680
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

151
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,440
♪I won't claim you♪

152
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:48,120
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

153
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:50,760
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

154
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:54,120
♪Waiting for you♪
